<hr/><h2>Make Definition</h2>
<p>
Test ID fixup defineit
</p>
<p>fixup f(m) = x^2 + 2x + 1</p>
<p>
<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="inline">
  <mrow>
    <mi>f</mi>
    <mo>&#x2062;</mo>
    <mfenced open="(" close=")">
      <mi>x</mi>
    </mfenced>
  </mrow>
  <mo form="infix">=</mo>
  <mrow>
    <msup>
      <mi>x</mi>
      <mn>2</mn>
    </msup>
    <mo form="infix">&#x2212;</mo>
    <mrow>
      <mn>2</mn>
      <mo>&#x2062;</mo>
      <mi>x</mi>
    </mrow>
    <mo form="infix">+</mo>
    <mn>1</mn>
  </mrow>
</math>

</p>
<p>
Test ID defineit
</p>
<p>define f(m) = x^2 + 2x + 1 after fixup</p>
